pages.computational-tools/index.html:
---
title: Computational Tools
description: Interactive tools and research prototypes for computational design, structural learning, fabrication, and spatial exploration.
---
<header class="page-heading tools-heading">
  <h1>Computational Tools</h1>
  <p class="lead">Tools for exploring geometry, material behavior, structural response, and fabrication. Open a working platform or follow its project page for methods and research.</p>
</header>
<section aria-labelledby="browser-tools-heading">
  <div class="catalog-group-heading"><h2 id="browser-tools-heading">Platforms &amp; plug-ins</h2></div>
  <div class="project-grid">
